/* Adapted from data_w4.sas (hajinjang-epi/screentime_isotemporal_substitution)
   The %iso2 macro is the linear-model counterpart to the paper's isotemporal
   substitution approach: a survey-weighted proc surveyreg regression of a
   continuous depression-symptom score (depsumw1) on the same set of daily
   time-use covariates (sleep, outdoor time, study time, screen-time
   components) used throughout the repo, with clparm/solution requested on
   the model statement. Model spec, class list, and macro body are kept
   verbatim; only the input rows below are synthetic (mock time-use panel
   data in place of the KCYPS2018 survey extract the original script reads
   via a local OneDrive libname). */

